WEBVTT

00:22:58.786 --> 00:23:04.379
telling them that partnership 
is providing you with that platform.

00:23:04.379 --> 00:23:07.780
What it takes from you now 
is to have the courage of showing

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:12.577
that you are really capable 
of providing a very interesting idea,

00:23:12.577 --> 00:23:15.112
and you are really an entrepreneur,

00:23:15.112 --> 00:23:19.152
that you are not afraid 
of sharing your ideas to the public,

00:23:19.152 --> 00:23:21.752
whether it's locally, 
regionally, or internationally.

00:23:22.234 --> 00:23:26.785
So now the plan for TED (Arabic)
is to have events, of course,

00:23:26.785 --> 00:23:27.884
have a website,

00:23:27.884 --> 00:23:31.904
including a flagship event in Doha 
at the end of the initiative,